7
00:00:23,254 --> 00:00:27,590
This July, Pakistan's space agency said cloud limited its checks.

8
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:32,839
NISAR, the new radar from NASA and ISRO, sees through cloud.

9
00:00:32,879 --> 00:00:36,179
At Attabad, the optical image is cloud;

10
00:00:36,219 --> 00:00:38,480
the radar shows the lake.

11
00:00:38,870 --> 00:00:44,397
We built SARtale. It reads every pass over each watched lake, thirty-nine so

12
00:00:44,437 --> 00:00:49,420
far, and gives one plain status, with what to do and who to contact.

13
00:00:49,810 --> 00:00:53,121
It refreshes every week, and anyone can add another glacial

14
00:00:53,161 --> 00:00:54,410
